      "updated": 1792029798739,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "File identity stays independent of location.\nEach device stores its own ID-to-path mappings.\n\nUnmapping is not a cloud deletion.\nNew edits during sync stay pending.\nUnresolved files do not block other files.",
      "originalText": "File identity stays independent of location.\nEach device stores its own ID-to-path mappings.\n\nUnmapping is not a cloud deletion.\nNew edits during sync stay pending.\nUnresolved files do not block other files.",
