      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "config.toml  : remote + root/path mappings\nrepo/        : managed Git clone\nstate.json   : per-file base + apply journal\nconflicts/   : base / local / remote bytes\n\nRetain pending captures on local Git refs.\nWrite durable bytes before state references.\nNever push private pending refs by default.",
      "originalText": "config.toml  : remote + root/path mappings\nrepo/        : managed Git clone\nstate.json   : per-file base + apply journal\nconflicts/   : base / local / remote bytes\n\nRetain pending captures on local Git refs.\nWrite durable bytes before state references.\nNever push private pending refs by default.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
