      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "chezmoi: separate source and destination;\npreserve attributes and ignore rules.\nStow: explicit ownership and conflict checks.\nyadm: ordinary files and Git recovery.\nDotbot: declarative mappings, generated\nautomatically by Abode.",
      "originalText": "chezmoi: separate source and destination;\npreserve attributes and ignore rules.\nStow: explicit ownership and conflict checks.\nyadm: ordinary files and Git recovery.\nDotbot: declarative mappings, generated\nautomatically by Abode.",
